              "id": "nd000006",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"section\" data-screen-label=\"Training tracks\">\n  <div class=\"section__head\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section__eyebrow\">Training tracks</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section__title\">Three tracks, <span class=\"italic\">one outcome</span> &mdash; people who use the systems you&rsquo;ve paid for.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"section__body\">\n      We build curricula around the software your team actually touches. No generic &ldquo;digital literacy.&rdquo; Real workflows, real screens, real consequences.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tracks\">\n    <div class=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"track__num\">Track 01 &middot; Odoo</div>\n      <h3 class=\"track__title\">Odoo end-user &amp; admin training</h3>\n      <p class=\"track__body\">Role-based programs across Sales, Finance, HR, Inventory, and Manufacturing. End-user paths and admin certifications.</p>\n      <ul class=\"track__list\">\n        <li>14 role-based modules</li>\n        <li>Version-current (17 &amp; 18)</li>\n        <li>Hands-on sandbox tenants</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"track__foot\"><span>6 weeks &middot; <b>EN / FR</b></span><span>From <b>$1,850</b></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"track__num\">Track 02 &middot; Security</div>\n      <h3 class=\"track__title\">Cybersecurity awareness</h3>\n      <p class=\"track__body\">Scenario-driven training for all-staff, developers, and finance. Paired with phishing exercises matched to your threat model.</p>\n      <ul class=\"track__list\">\n        <li>All-staff baseline &middot; 45 min</li>\n        <li>Dev &amp; finance deep-dives</li>\n        <li>Phishing + reporting cadence</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"track__foot\"><span>Ongoing &middot; <b>EN / FR / AR</b></span><span>From <b>$48 / learner</b></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"track__num\">Track 03 &middot; Digital</div>\n      <h3 class=\"track__title\">Digital marketing fundamentals</h3>\n      <p class=\"track__body\">SEO, SEM, analytics, and content strategy &mdash; taught by the team running campaigns, not by a certification slide deck.</p>\n      <ul class=\"track__list\">\n        <li>SEO &amp; content programs</li>\n        <li>Paid media &middot; Google + Meta</li>\n        <li>GA4 + Looker Studio</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"track__foot\"><span>4 weeks &middot; <b>EN / FR</b></span><span>From <b>$1,450</b></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "html"
            }
          ],
          "isInner": false
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
