                "html": "<section class=\"proof\" data-screen-label=\"Training proof\">\n  <blockquote class=\"proof__quote\">\n    The team finally stopped fighting Odoo. Four weeks of focused training did what eighteen months of internal docs couldn&rsquo;t &mdash; our close time dropped from ten days to three.\n  </blockquote>\n  <div class=\"proof__by\">\n    <div class=\"proof__avatar\">MD</div>\n    <div class=\"proof__by-who\"><b>Marc Desjardins</b><span>CFO, Atlas Logistics &middot; Montr&eacute;al</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
